      "**Echoes of the Dawn**\n",
      "\n",
      "When the first light slips through the hush of night,  \n",
      "A silver thread of hope weaves through the dark.  \n",
      "It paints the sky with colors soft and bright,  \n",
      "And lifts the weary heart to leave its mark.\n",
      "\n",
      "The wind, a quiet bard, sings songs of old,  \n",
      "Its whispers dancing on the river's edge.  \n",
      "It tells of stories brave, yet untold,  \n",
